  "description": "Details of condition 4 (DEMP) as required by planning permission ref. 24/AP/2732 dated 27/11/2024 for 'Demolition of an Building in a Conservation Area The building is fire-damaged, former clubhouse of the Southwark Lawn Bowls and Social Club. A single storey structure located on the east side of the sports grounds the dismantling the timber roof structure, removing all the external and internal walls and breaking up the floor slab and grubbing out the foundations, to leave the site of the clubhouse free from all structures. A lean-to store and toilet facilities formed from metal sheeting and timber construction around the NE corner of the building will also be cleared away'.",
